# 不配平的 NBT（花括号）在 scoreboard 两条命令上真服怎么报。
#
# 2026-10-21 实测准备：
#   - scoreboard players set 需要一个已存在的 objective
#   - 持有者用 @e[type=armor_stand]，所以先召唤一个盔甲架
#   - 每一对命令之间夹一条 say M<n> 标记，因为探针是按行收集输出的
--- console ---
say M00
scoreboard objectives add t dummy
summon armor_stand 2 4 0 {CustomName:"NBT_AS"}
say M01
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] t 1 {Tags
say M02
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] t 1 {Tags:1
say M03
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] t 1 {
say M04
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] t 1 {Tags:1,
say M05
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] t 1 {Tags:"abc
say M06
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] t 1 {}
say M07
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] add marked {Tags
say M08
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] add marked {Tags:1
say M09
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] add marked {
say M10
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] add marked {Tags:1,
say M11
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] add marked {Tags:"abc
say M12
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] add marked {}
say M13
